# Qwen Code (optional)

Once per session, if you are about to do a bounded grep/review/mechanical
extract, run `python3 tool/qwen_assist.py --probe`. If `"available"` is true,
follow `.cursor/skills/qwen-code/SKILL.md`. If it is false, continue without
Qwen — do not block, install, or wait on secrets.

Never let Qwen rewrite god files, rename persisted strings, push, or merge.
Cursor owns the PR; Qwen is a helper.
